    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: Renewal SBQQ__Quote__c records still in Draft status after the originating contract&apos;s end date.
Why it matters: A draft renewal past contract end means no active subscription, no recognized revenue, and a customer technically out-of-contract. Operational and revenue risk simultaneously.
Suppress a finding: when a documented customer pause / renegotiation is in flight.
Disable the detector: only when draft renewals past contract end are expected. Most should leave this on.</value></values>
